{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0524_1000_p", "source_sha256": "15a69e4f5d53afc7d12d913d3938c8a35a3df68d7802d2c480bc1657a691522e", "ja": "（今日は雑誌のピンナップ撮影。風花がデザインを\n考えた服に合わせて、場所はモダンな洋館だ）", "zh": "（今天是杂志的插页照片拍摄。地点是现代风格的西式宅邸，正好配合风花设计的服装。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0524_1001_041fuk", "source_sha256": "6cceaa1c70b7bd719402ad05692d3e5b098c3ac97ce917ec0dc3b0f8d27e9991", "ja": "わあ、すごくクラシカルな洋館……！\n物静かで上品で、この服にぴったりですね♪", "zh": "哇，好古典的洋馆……！\n既幽静又高雅，和这套衣服太相配了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0524_1002_p", "source_sha256": "7cc5f2297774778254105c5b02d6270bc2cbcfa110bfbb9e16e4f7e2130277e6", "ja": "そうだな。\nよかったよ、雰囲気のいい場所が見つかって。", "zh": "是啊。\n能找到氛围这么好的地方，真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0524_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "0cbbb0aa56f4aaa3afba07e73a8812046a7811bbd896256c3a2a7360ca47f115", "ja": "もしかして、ここ……\n{$P$}さんが探してくれたんですか？", "zh": "难道说，这里是……\n{$P$}先生帮忙找的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0524_1004_p", "source_sha256": "cf92ca8273db0a73531d2025b8d958eb8dd3eaabe308d0b65365216d6d87a503", "ja": "まあ、少し手伝っただけだよ。写真のイメージを\n聞いた時に、編集さんが場所を探してるって言ってて。", "zh": "哎，只是帮了一点小忙而已。在听到照片的构想时，\n编辑说正在找拍摄地点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0524_1005_041fuk", "source_sha256": "fc337910b741c668654e18a0079bb60789531eef76336d4d8a8d195277d7e65c", "ja": "……。あの、もしかして{$P$}さんの\nお仕事って、ものすごく大変なんじゃ……？", "zh": "……那个，难道{$P$}先生的工作，\n其实非常辛苦吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0524_1006_p", "source_sha256": "216d792f3f03372335657f0b65517401261c4b5b6e57d213bd0cfa627cd8fefb", "ja": "え……っ？　急にどうした？", "zh": "诶……？怎么突然这么说？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0524_1007_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e00b0f9bffb7617b9bb8d94de9751d4e0a29979474744b5728a8067a8df62126", "ja": "……今回、自分で服のデザインを考えていて、\n改めて思ったんです。", "zh": "……这次我自己构思服装设计时，\n再次深深地体会到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0524_1008_041fuk", "source_sha256": "5b94978bb7c70de53c4e04a428bd1e46a02b82f83d3ba6ac812dd17af4b79a38", "ja": "自由に考えていいって言われた時は、\n清楚な感じにしようって、理想があったんです。", "zh": "被告知可以自由构思时，我原本有个理想，想设计得清纯端庄一些。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0524_1009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4ea0740effbf5bb80fc619f9eb57ad03f80b5e9019529b40b846fa2f8a226b63", "ja": "でも、いざ作り始めたら、どこか違って……。", "zh": "可是，真正开始制作后，却总觉得哪里不太对……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0524_1010_p", "source_sha256": "7479be9777ce5f1eb097280b1bdda6c5dbab06d7eafa76d986987d9a1cd0fea7", "ja": "まあ、頭の中のイメージを、\n実際に形にするのは難しいからな。", "zh": "是啊，要把脑海中的构想\n实际变成具体形态，确实挺难的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0524_1011_041fuk", "source_sha256": "10590247cc2e2b590323e6c700e4c2d42584bd6d10f06ff05edd27718f7a3bd4", "ja": "はい……。一部を変えたら、やっぱりこっちもとか。\n元の方がいいかも……ってなってしまって。", "zh": "是的……改了一部分之后，就会觉得这边也得改改。然后又会想，或许原来的更好……就变成这样了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0524_1012_041fuk", "source_sha256": "87f9df978002d8c192c5456c83647967bb333b00a99caa3303122201e991e190", "ja": "デザイナーさんには、\n何度も無理な注文をしちゃった気がします……。", "zh": "我好像让设计师一次又一次地按照我的无理要求修改了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0524_1013_p", "source_sha256": "088467b9956438bbd26f80bb49947fc9caffa35445274fce28b84d631cd48bc2", "ja": "大丈夫だと思うよ。デザイナーさんもプロだからな。\n風花の真剣な気持ちをわかってるはずだ。", "zh": "我觉得没问题的。设计师也是专业人士嘛。\n一定能理解风花这份认真的心意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0524_1014_041fuk", "source_sha256": "9e30a89e7aab1f646c104f370917d5a41688a3221c029c5ac6b0b4057e01142e", "ja": "そうだといいですけど……。\n自己プロデュースですら、こんなに大変なのに……。", "zh": "要是那样就好了……。连自我制作都这么辛苦……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0524_1015_041fuk", "source_sha256": "1ab1995b94632361d5267075072ac81ac8e499ba6050356764ba7369dbcab049", "ja": "他の人をプロデュースするなんて、なおさら……。\n{$P$}さんは、すごいですね。", "zh": "要制作其他人的话，就更是如此了……{$P$}先生真厉害。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0524_1016_p", "source_sha256": "f33ec511f84d0d44db9af142355825ff564e19f01215c7532e1584341230609f", "ja": "いや、すごいのは風花たち、アイドルのみんなだよ。\n俺はあくまで、手伝ってるだけだ。", "zh": "不，真正厉害的是风花她们，是偶像们大家。\n我只是在帮忙而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0524_1017_p", "source_sha256": "e81256e17a06a1e9e0fa6e88ec1bc8463b47dd775d5e0cef0ee91f9c428d2757", "ja": "風花の理想があったから、その服が完成したように。\nみんなの理想を叶える手伝いをしてるだけなんだ。", "zh": "正因为有风花的理想，这套服装才能完成。\n我只是在帮大家实现理想而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0524_1018_041fuk", "source_sha256": "665e2e6d502dda04c3988c6a2803494b14a399631b3f69fb1bc62e7188657627", "ja": "手伝いなんて、そんな……。理想を形にしてくれる人が\nいるからこそ、私たちは活動できるんです！", "zh": "帮忙什么的，您太客气了……正因为有您这样将理想化为现实的人，我们才能开展活动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0524_1019_041fuk", "source_sha256": "8e80b7ef74c5bdd4ce90344f19d43d80d035cc8f40aef9a60f832998367367bf", "ja": "なのに私、清純派アイドル！　グラビアは控えめで！\nなんて、もしかしてすごくワガママだったんじゃ……？", "zh": "可是我却说什么“我是清纯派偶像！写真拍摄要收敛一点！”之类的话，会不会其实太任性了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0524_1020_p", "source_sha256": "9acf63882f5147b39143c90feeb8b7d1812fb1fe2f675450914263ef5f5dfeed", "ja": "いやいや。希望はどんどん言ってくれ！\nやりたいことの方向性が定まるから、助かってるんだ。", "zh": "哪里哪里。有什么期望尽管提！\n这样能明确你想走的方向，其实帮了我大忙呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0524_1021_041fuk", "source_sha256": "498a28e368404787a6c9aceeab0d9ea72761896b99cde913f3e1b5275dfdb7a0", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。\n本当に私たちのために、いつもありがとうございます！", "zh": "{$P$}先生……。\n真的一直以来都在为我们着想，非常感谢您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0524_1022_p", "source_sha256": "7a50aeedf6e36980c89fd35889e1b979126a5f8a24e801d01f10db5d276eca7e", "ja": "あ、改めて言われると照れるな……。とりあえず、\n撮影まで時間があるし、中を見て回らないか？", "zh": "啊，被你这么郑重地一说，反而让我有点不好意思……总之，距离拍摄还有些时间，要不要先在里面逛逛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0524_1023_041fuk", "source_sha256": "9a5dbac9cff92ef5409966808911f96999abd1d89215e697f1761609dbc808c5", "ja": "ふふ、はい！　せっかく見つけてくれた場所ですし、\nしっかり見学して、撮影に活かしますね♪", "zh": "呵呵，好呀！难得是你找到的地方，我得好好参观一番，把它运用到拍摄中♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0524_1024_p", "source_sha256": "b798b8a7ca62949517354c844570f4dfb2d368063aacca0eedea12460f882829", "ja": "（下見をしたおかげか、良い写真がたくさん撮れた。\n風花の魅力が一番伝わる、最高の一枚を選ばないと！）", "zh": "（或许是因为提前踩了点，拍到了好多好照片。得选出最能展现风花魅力的那一张才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
